+// Exclusive set-associative L2 TLB - fixed.
+//
+// The exclusive policy keeps every translation in exactly one level: cold
+// fills enter L1, L1 victims spill to L2, and an L2 hit is promoted to L1
+// only after its L2 copy is removed. Fixes relative to
+// tlb.cc.exclusive.sa include PCID-qualified demap, L2 checkpoint state,
+// safe promotion when a spill can replace the source L2 way, and
+// runtime-selectable geometry/hash/replacement/spill policy.
+//
+// Runtime parameters: EXCL_L2_SETS (1..4096, rounded up to power of two),
+// EXCL_L2_WAYS (1..16), EXCL_L2_HASH (0=xor7, 1=modulo, 2=xor-fold),
+// EXCL_L2_REPL (0=LRU, 1=FIFO, 2=random), EXCL_L1_SIZE (>0 overrides
+// SimObject size), and EXCL_SPILL (always, dirty-hot, or never; default
+// always). dirty-hot spills a translation only after at least two successful
+// write translations while it remains cached.
